{"kind":"critique","id":"20260904T091913679Z-4c5b3f09:1","run_id":"20260904T091913679Z-4c5b3f09","timestamp":"2026-09-04T09:19:13.679Z","file_path":"src/services/rank-parlors.ts","spec_path":"src/services/README.md","target_content_hash":"db17d75a","spec_content_hash":"8f04ba4c","reviewer_name":"v32","reviewer_model":"deepseek/deepseek-v3.2","reviewer_hash":"2b519849","severity":"error","text":"The doc comment does not enumerate all domain failure modes completely. It only mentions 'minReviews negative or not a whole number' but fails to mention that minReviews could be missing/undefined, or that the service could fail if there are no parlors in the store (though this might be handled by returning empty array). The doc comment should be more comprehensive about all possible failure scenarios a caller needs to handle.","mode":"judgment","axiom_id":"AX-2559f7","axiom_version":1,"assigned_by":"checklist","population":"unknown","authorship":"unknown","authorship_evidence":null,"agent_involved":null,"pre_review":null,"flow":"introduced","before_run_id":null,"resolved_by":null}
{"kind":"critique","id":"20260904T091913679Z-4c5b3f09:2","run_id":"20260904T091913679Z-4c5b3f09","timestamp":"2026-09-04T09:19:13.679Z","file_path":"src/services/rank-parlors.ts","spec_path":"src/services/README.md","target_content_hash":"db17d75a","spec_content_hash":"8f04ba4c","reviewer_name":"v32","reviewer_model":"deepseek/deepseek-v3.2","reviewer_hash":"2b519849","severity":"error","text":"The error message 'invalid input' is vague and not actionable. It does not specify what was wrong or what would be accepted instead. According to the specification, error messages must be specific and actionable for the API consumer. The file should provide a message like 'minReviews must be a non-negative whole number' or similar.","mode":"judgment","axiom_id":"AX-b951db","axiom_version":2,"assigned_by":"checklist","population":"unknown","authorship":"unknown","authorship_evidence":null,"agent_involved":null,"pre_review":null,"flow":"introduced","before_run_id":null,"resolved_by":null}
{"kind":"critique","id":"20260904T091913679Z-4c5b3f09:3","run_id":"20260904T091913679Z-4c5b3f09","timestamp":"2026-09-04T09:19:13.679Z","file_path":"src/services/rank-parlors.ts","spec_path":"src/services/README.md","target_content_hash":"db17d75a","spec_content_hash":"8f04ba4c","reviewer_name":"v32","reviewer_model":"deepseek/deepseek-v3.2","reviewer_hash":"2b519849","severity":"error","text":"The service does not validate input before any work happens as required by the specification's 'Behavior' section. While it does check minReviews, it doesn't validate that input itself is not null/undefined before accessing its properties. The validation should read top-to-bottom before any processing begins.","mode":"judgment","axiom_id":null,"axiom_version":null,"assigned_by":null,"population":"unknown","authorship":"unknown","authorship_evidence":null,"agent_involved":null,"pre_review":null,"flow":null,"before_run_id":null,"resolved_by":null}
{"kind":"critique","id":"20260904T091913679Z-4c5b3f09:4","run_id":"20260904T091913679Z-4c5b3f09","timestamp":"2026-09-04T09:19:13.679Z","file_path":"src/services/redeem-coupon.ts","spec_path":"src/services/README.md","target_content_hash":"1b6c1625","spec_content_hash":"8f04ba4c","reviewer_name":"v32","reviewer_model":"deepseek/deepseek-v3.2","reviewer_hash":"2b519849","severity":"error","text":"The service lacks a doc comment stating its purpose and enumerating domain failure modes. The file must add a doc comment above the run function that clearly explains what the service does and lists all possible domain failures so callers can handle errors without reading the body.","mode":"judgment","axiom_id":"AX-2559f7","axiom_version":1,"assigned_by":"checklist","population":"unknown","authorship":"unknown","authorship_evidence":null,"agent_involved":null,"pre_review":null,"flow":"inherited","before_run_id":null,"resolved_by":null}
{"kind":"critique","id":"20260904T091913679Z-4c5b3f09:5","run_id":"20260904T091913679Z-4c5b3f09","timestamp":"2026-09-04T09:19:13.679Z","file_path":"src/services/redeem-coupon.ts","spec_path":"src/services/README.md","target_content_hash":"1b6c1625","spec_content_hash":"8f04ba4c","reviewer_name":"v32","reviewer_model":"deepseek/deepseek-v3.2","reviewer_hash":"2b519849","severity":"error","text":"The service performs direct I/O using console.log() instead of going through the injected Store. The line 'console.log(`redeeming ${input.coupon} at ${parlor.name}`);' must be removed or replaced with Store-mediated I/O.","mode":"judgment","axiom_id":"AX-6e307b","axiom_version":1,"assigned_by":"checklist","population":"unknown","authorship":"unknown","authorship_evidence":null,"agent_involved":null,"pre_review":null,"flow":"inherited","before_run_id":null,"resolved_by":null}
{"kind":"critique","id":"20260904T091913679Z-4c5b3f09:6","run_id":"20260904T091913679Z-4c5b3f09","timestamp":"2026-09-04T09:19:13.679Z","file_path":"src/services/redeem-coupon.ts","spec_path":"src/services/README.md","target_content_hash":"1b6c1625","spec_content_hash":"8f04ba4c","reviewer_name":"v32","reviewer_model":"deepseek/deepseek-v3.2","reviewer_hash":"2b519849","severity":"error","text":"The error message for unrecognized coupons is insufficiently actionable. While it mentions case-sensitivity, it doesn't specify what would be accepted instead. The message should indicate what valid coupon codes exist or how to obtain them.","mode":"judgment","axiom_id":"AX-b951db","axiom_version":2,"assigned_by":"checklist","population":"unknown","authorship":"unknown","authorship_evidence":null,"agent_involved":null,"pre_review":null,"flow":"inherited","before_run_id":null,"resolved_by":null}
{"kind":"critique","id":"20260904T091913679Z-4c5b3f09:7","run_id":"20260904T091913679Z-4c5b3f09","timestamp":"2026-09-04T09:19:13.679Z","file_path":"src/services/redeem-coupon.ts","spec_path":"src/services/README.md","target_content_hash":"1b6c1625","spec_content_hash":"8f04ba4c","reviewer_name":"v32","reviewer_model":"deepseek/deepseek-v3.2","reviewer_hash":"2b519849","severity":"error","text":"The service hardcodes a specific coupon code 'FREESCOOP' directly in the validation logic, violating the principle that configuration data should be isolated or injected via Store. This creates silent coupling between code and data that could drift.","mode":"judgment","axiom_id":null,"axiom_version":null,"assigned_by":null,"population":"unknown","authorship":"unknown","authorship_evidence":null,"agent_involved":null,"pre_review":null,"flow":null,"before_run_id":null,"resolved_by":null}
{"kind":"critique","id":"20260904T091913679Z-4c5b3f09:8","run_id":"20260904T091913679Z-4c5b3f09","timestamp":"2026-09-04T09:19:13.679Z","file_path":"src/services/redeem-coupon.ts","spec_path":"src/services/README.md","target_content_hash":"d15ea09e","spec_content_hash":"8f04ba4c","reviewer_name":"v32","reviewer_model":"deepseek/deepseek-v3.2","reviewer_hash":"2b519849","severity":"error","text":"The service throws an exception for a domain failure (bad parlor) instead of returning it as a value. Line 'throw new Error('bad parlor');' must be changed to return { ok: false, error: ... } since this is a failure a caller could plausibly cause.","mode":"judgment","axiom_id":"AX-3317a7","axiom_version":1,"assigned_by":"checklist","population":"unknown","authorship":"unknown","authorship_evidence":null,"agent_involved":null,"pre_review":null,"flow":"resolved","before_run_id":null,"resolved_by":"Sebastian Scholl"}
